  <!-- SECTION 2: VISUAL TIMELINE -->
  <section id="visual-timeline" class="content-section reveal" aria-label="Visual Timeline">
    <h2>2. Visual Timeline: Northern vs. Southern Hemisphere Cycles</h2>
    <p>
      Because summer occurs in opposite months across the equator, northern and southern hemisphere nations operate on opposing DST calendar schedules. The SVG graphic below illustrates this seasonal duality throughout the 2026 calendar year.
    </p>

    <div style="margin: 2.5rem 0; text-align: center; border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--panel);">
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 800 260" width="100%" height="auto" style="display: block; margin: 0 auto;">
        <rect width="800" height="260" fill="#0f172a" rx="10" />
        <text x="400" y="30" font-family="'Space Grotesk', sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="16" fill="#8fd7ff" text-anchor="middle">2026 Global DST Transition Cycles</text>
        
        <!-- Months Axis -->
        <g transform="translate(50, 60)" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#64748b">
          <text x="0">Jan</text><text x="60">Feb</text><text x="120">Mar</text><text x="180">Apr</text>
          <text x="240">May</text><text x="300">Jun</text><text x="360">Jul</text><text x="420">Aug</text>
          <text x="480">Sep</text><text x="540">Oct</text><text x="600">Nov</text><text x="660">Dec</text>
        </g>
        
        <!-- Northern Hemisphere Bar (US/EU) -->
        <text x="50" y="110" font-family="'Space Grotesk', sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#38bdf8">Northern Hemisphere (US / EU):</text>
        <rect x="50" y="120" width="135" height="24" fill="#334155" rx="4" />
        <text x="115" y="136" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#94a3b8" text-anchor="middle">Standard Time</text>
        
        <rect x="185" y="120" width="415" height="24" fill="#36c7b5" fill-opacity="0.4" stroke="#36c7b5" rx="4" />
        <text x="390" y="136" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="#6ee7b7" font-weight="bold" text-anchor="middle">Daylight Saving / Summer Time Active (Mar - Oct/Nov)</text>
        
        <rect x="600" y="120" width="150" height="24" fill="#334155" rx="4" />
        <text x="675" y="136" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#94a3b8" text-anchor="middle">Standard Time</text>

        <!-- Southern Hemisphere Bar (Australia / NZ) -->
        <text x="50" y="185" font-family="'Space Grotesk', sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#f59e0b">Southern Hemisphere (Australia / NZ):</text>
